        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm a fan of Adam's old timey radio voice. &nbsp; I wonder if we could get an Interlude episode where he talks in that voice the whole time. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If that ever does happen, he needs to talk through a tolet paper/paper towel tube to make it sound official.</p>",
