        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-03T11:01:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Phantom5613\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/48/1906_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Phantom5613:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Pretty sure we heard all we needed to for F6 AZ, and since apparently no-one asked them to talk about it, they didn't.Moral of the story: If we wanna hear about a certain topic durring an episode, we gotta ask.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not always true. &nbsp;I've had questions for this episode and others that did not get answered.</p>",
