        "id": 197474,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-03T18:48:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So Tachyon spent time inventing … a Jukebox? SUPER SCIENCE!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Much more than that, she invented a way to transmit audio from a record player to his cryo chamber without interfering with the sound quality.</p>\n<p>For people who understand the difference in audio quality, and how easy it is to mess with that, esp. when you consider there are fans involved. . . Tachyon pulled off something remarkable there.</p>",
