        "id": 197475,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-05T00:03:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's pretty cool to learn that Absolute Zero's body doesn't just have cold powers or isn't just really cold itself - it's like he's in suspended animation, but still conscious and able to move. Creepy/awesome, I guess. That's not an idea I've seen before.</p><p>I like that Ryan Frost appears mostly in the F5 team comics, and he has an interesting role to play there. It's kind of fun to think of him in his cryo chamber, heckling Tachyon while she works to start the exposition.</p>",
